      "updated": 1793887290012,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. Thread seats and registers both say 6; the first pool is the limiter (thread seats). Block seats keep 18 unused.\n6 blocks x 36 SMs = 216 blocks per wave; 2,955 / 216 = 13.7 = 14 waves.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. Thread seats and registers both say 6; the first pool is the limiter (thread seats). Block seats keep 18 unused.\n6 blocks x 36 SMs = 216 blocks per wave; 2,955 / 216 = 13.7 = 14 waves.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
